# --- 🔄 Template Sync ---
#
# Every path tannergolden/path ships, and whether 🔄 Template Sync keeps it current
# in this repository. How it all works: .github/template-sync.md, beside this.
#
# A line naming a path keeps it current. A `#` with no space before a path -
# `#/README.md` - leaves that path to you. A line starting `# ` is a note.
#
# To keep a file as yours, put a `#` in front of its line; to have the
# template keep it current again, take the `#` away. Rules of your own - a
# pattern like `!/docs/**` to stop a whole folder - go under "Your rules" at
# the end, and win over everything above them. Each sync redraws this file
# from the template's latest list and keeps every choice you made in it.

